# Flik's frogs at the Darkmoon Faire.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, stock; Flik's two Faire spots, in
# Elwynn Forest and Mulgore); the TDB's vendor rows (Wood Frog Box: one in
# stock, restocked every 30 minutes; Tree Frog Box unlimited; Classic data);
# Forever's client data 1.60.1.70532 (ItemSparse prices: 1g each; every pet
# item teaches its companion when used).
# ASSUMED: The Darkmoon Faire comes to Forever as in Classic, alternating
# between Elwynn Forest (south of Goldshire) and Mulgore (near Thunder Bluff)
# month by month (Classic flow; Forever has not shown the Faire yet, and the
# reputation guides say so too). In-game check: the first Faire after launch.

step Flik at the Darkmoon Faire
  tip Flik sells two frogs (1g each) while the Darkmoon Faire is in town; Forever has not shown the Faire yet. In Classic it sets up south of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest one month and near Thunder Bluff in Mulgore the next; go to whichever is up. Flik runs all over the Faire grounds, so look around for him. He carries only one Wood Frog Box at a time and restocks it about every 30 minutes: if he has none, someone just bought it. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 14860                        -- Flik
  buy 11026 npc 14860 optional        -- Tree Frog Box, 1g
  buy 11027 npc 14860 optional        -- Wood Frog Box, 1g
